diff --git a/Changes b/Changes
index 6bfb98f..aa6a031 100644
--- a/Changes
+++ b/Changes
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 Revision history for Red-Driver-MySQL
 
 {{$NEXT}}
+    - Preserve AUTO_INCREMENT and ordered UNIQUE groups in catalog and CREATE TABLE introspection
+    - Keep migration plans consistent with existing MySQL schemas
     - Execute savepoint operations through MySQL's text protocol, including dry runs
     - Test quoted savepoints, repeated rollback, release and constraint-error recovery
     - Support Red's declarative indexes through ordered MySQL STATISTICS catalog inspection
